Product ID
Product name
Product price
Stock quantity
Category
Product status
Created date
Product metadata in JSON

Business rules:
price > 0
stock >= 0
status has controlled values

Write the CREATE TABLE

73. Orders Table
Design: orders

Requirements:
order_id
customer_id
store_id
order_date
total_amount
status

Business rules:
Every order must belong to a customer
Every order must belong to a store
Order amount cannot be negative
Status cannot be missing
New orders should default to 'PLACED'

Write the complete table definition with appropriate keys and constraints
